    {
      "id": "action_network:6dbcfaa2-53b4-42cd-ba2f-c8a899c9cc38",
      "name": "Healthcare Working Group Halloween Social ",
      "date": "2026-10-31T14:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "2:00 PM, Saturday October 31, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-10",
      "month_label": "October 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<p>Join us for a hang out at The Gutter LES for some drinks and bowling!</p>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/healthcare-working-group-halloween-social",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/healthcare-working-group-halloween-social",
      "location": "77 Essex St",
      "borough": "New York"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_network:98121530-ccd5-455f-9e15-316f17d124fb",
      "name": "Healthcare Working Group Coffee with Comrades",
      "date": "2026-11-08T10:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "10:00 AM, Sunday November 8, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-11",
      "month_label": "November 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<p>Can't afford health insurance? Unsure what to do about the mess of US healthcare?</p><p><strong>Join the NYC DSA healthcare working group for a casual chat and a coffee in Queens!</strong></p><p>This will be an informal small group gathering where we can get to know each other, discuss the US healthcare system and the work we do in DSA to win Healthcare for All. Discuss the upcoming DSA convention and our working group's resolution to prioritize the New York Health Act in 2027 and win universal healthcare in NY.</p><p><span></span>There will be a mix of experienced and new members, all are welcome to join, even if you\u2019re not a member of DSA yet. Come and go as you please.</p><p>A healthcare working group onboarder will be there to help answer any questions you may have about our work, or DSA in general!</p>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/healthcare-working-group-coffee-with-comrades",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/healthcare-working-group-coffee-with-comrades",
      "location": "32-09 Crescent St",
      "borough": "Queens"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_network:3ad94bae-a33e-48ef-8402-371a046d3dd8",
      "name": "Statewide NY Health Act Town Hall",
      "date": "2026-11-10T18:30:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "6:30 PM, Tuesday November 10, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-11",
      "month_label": "November 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<div>Healthcare for All Statewide Town Hall!</div><div><br></div><div>Healthcare bills and barriers are too high! Join healthcare workers, union members, and community advocates for a statewide town hall on the New York Health Act and what universal healthcare could mean for you and your family.</div><div><br></div><div>\ud83d\udcc5 Tuesday, November 10 | 6:30\u20138:30 PM</div><div>\ud83d\udccd 1199SEIU Headquarters, 498 7th Ave, NYC</div><div><br></div><div>Come learn about the New York Health Act, ask questions, and connect with others organizing for healthcare for all New Yorkers!</div><div><br></div><div>Everyone is welcome! Please share widely.</div><div><br></div><div>To join us via Zoom please complete the Registration Form, You will receive the Zoom details once you have Registered</div>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/statewide-ny-health-act-town-hall",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/statewide-ny-health-act-town-hall",
      "location": "498 7th Ave. ",
      "borough": "New York"
    }
  ],
